{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03128","headline":"酬通事舍人寓直见示篇中兼起居陆舍人景献 · 张九龄","name":"酬通事舍人寓直见示篇中兼起居陆舍人景献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轩掖殊清秘，才华固在斯。\n兴因膏泽洒，情与惠风吹。\n所美应人誉，何私亦我仪。\n同声感乔木，比翼谢长离。\n价以陆生减，贤慙鲍叔知。\n薄游尝独媿，芳讯乃兼施。\n此夜金闺籍，伊人琼树枝。\n飞鸣复何远，相顾幸媞媞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03128.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03128","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}